[[Ice Armor]] is an [[Armor]] normally obtained by combining the [[Leather Armor]] with a [[Snowball]], although it can also be obtained in the shop if playing as a [[Pyromancer]] with [[Frozen Flame]]. It gives much more {{icon/block}} than the [[Leather Armor]] and inflicts {{icon/cold}}. It can consume {{icon/heat}} to inflict additional {{icon/cold}} and gain additional {{icon/block}}.
